# Global Holst · ALL Pages · ALL Sections (LOCKED)

**User order (memory):** **ALL pages + ALL sections** (Master + Store admin) — color + font **global Holst** se. BrandingPanel / `portal-tokens.css`. Blue/indigo CTA, filter, link, icon, focus → Holst teal. Naya hardcoded blue/indigo/purple brand palette **mat** banao.

## Scope = everything admin
- Dashboard, Products, Orders, Customers, Shipping, Payments, Invoices, Pages, Marketing, Reports, SEO, WhatsApp, Settings, Media, Themes, Master screens, **every** subsection/tab/modal/drawer.
- CSS remap under `[data-portal="master|store"]` covers legacy Tailwind blue/indigo utilities — still prefer tokens in new code.
- **Not** locked storefront theme chrome (coffee HiBrew / flowers storefront look).

## Tokens
- CTA → `unity-btn-primary` or `background: var(--portal-cta)` + white text
- Accent / active chip / link / icon / focus → `var(--accent)`
- Surfaces → `var(--surface)` / `var(--border)` / `var(--text)` / `var(--muted)` / inputs
- Font → `var(--font-ui)` (already on portal); no one-off admin font faces

## Ban
- Brand chrome: `bg-blue-*` / `bg-indigo-*` / `text-indigo-*` / `focus:border-blue-*` as primary brand
- Hardcoded modal headers `#0b1b36`, random green/blue primary CTAs
- Status OK: emerald / amber / rose when semantic (Paid / Pending / danger)

## Modals
- Header → `var(--portal-cta)`; primary → `unity-btn-primary`; shell → `GlobalModal`
